- Use Figma's MCP to understand more about the design we're trying to achieve.
- The final design is in "Ready for Dev" page in Figma
- When importing the design from Figma, note that the Figma designers use absolute sizes (in pixels) for width/height of components. You will need to compensate for that fact when importing, as we want things relative to screen size in our case.
- We have no mobile UI/viewport design. So use your judgement to compensate for that fact.